The 2004 directory contains the original presentation by Gaudenz Steinlin.
The 2006 directory contains an updated version by Frans Pop used at FOSDEM.

The slides are made with LaTeX using the "beamer" class.

To build on Debian, install the packages texlive-latex-recommended and
texlive-pictures and run 'pdflatex d-i_internals.tex' twice in one of the
directories.